2112	01010000A0E6100000D23BD5DBBBCF51C0433337A92AE73DC00000000000000000	2140	La Serena	truck	Wed, 22 Apr 2026 22:01:00 GMT	Oscar	Truck for the ToiToi toilets, retrieving grey water and adding fresh one. Talked bad about the Venezuelans but also has a kid with a woman from Venezuela, so he acknowledged that there are also some good people from there, but he thinks the majority is bad. But he also wants to go visit there, also to get to know the relatives of his woman. Fun guy otherwise, once he took someone hitchhiking and got assaulted, the guy took out a knife and wanted the truck. Without thinking he reacted and basically threw the guy half out of the window. Now he rarely takes people but decided to stop for me. Drove like 10min further to leave me in the center, gave me his number and offered me to stay at his place the next time I pass through here. When he called his wife the way of talking to her was so sweet.	\N	\N	1	waypoint	\N	\N
