2115	01010000A0E610000030C6FA5B059351C0F6B0324643673BC00000000000000000	2143	Copiapo	truck	Wed, 22 Apr 2026 22:05:00 GMT	Christian	Truck driver, sweet guy but didn’t stop talking for the whole 5h. Told me so many stories about other hitchhikers he took, one being Saul from the UK, who I then also sent a message, because he still had his phone number. He even once took two young Canadian girls, he told me how they asked him to take them, but he was going to rest first. They didn’t have a place to sleep, so he offered them the truck. He let them shower at the rest area, and apparently they came back just in their towels and almost naked. Another truck driver kept staring and gesturing him to share the girls, but he closed the blinds and treated them respectfully. They had tea and dinner together and they slept each one in the seats of the truck. He said he doesn’t have a pijama and therefore slept naked, but they did not care. He drove them far north, and then the next day waited for them to take them back again. They in the end asked him if he’s gay, but he said no, that he has a daughter their age and was just respectful. He kept asking me about girls, I wasn’t sure what to say because some truck drivers are homohobc, but at some point I told him I like guys. He was very sweet about it, told me the story about a friend of his that abandoned his son and wife because the son was gay. Christian told him straight that his behaviour is not okay at all and that he is still his son. Also that he will regret it once he’s old. Another crazy story he told me is that his sister once got to know a Swedish (or Swiss) gay guy. They became friends and the swedish guy invited her to Sweden. There he asked for her hand, for several reasons. One being so he can more easily stay in Chile, also for her to go to Europe and also because his family was not accepting and to shut them up. They actually did it, she has the European passport now and they are still married, but live different lives.  He also told me about his daughter that was bullied a lot at school, so he sent her to do some martial art for defense. The next time the two girls at school bothered her, she told them so come and hit me, and immediately turned their hits back on them and they were both on the floor. He was then called to the principle because the other two girls were hurt, but he clearly told the whole story of the bullying, the expensive glasses they destroyed. He told me that he wanted his daughter to become more self confident and be able to hit back, defend herself.  	\N	\N	1	waypoint	\N	\N
2116	01010000A0E6100000AE34B704769751C0FC7EF9EC5D573BC00000000000000000	2144	Copec Copiapo	car	Wed, 22 Apr 2026 22:06:00 GMT	Franklin	Saved me, arrived late and there were no buses anymore. He works as Uber, but drive me to the gas station for free. He’s from Venezuela and told me that he knows how it is to hitchhike, since that’s how he left Venezuela in the height of the crisis. He hitchhiked to Colombia with nothing, a small backpack with some clothes and zero money. His phone did not work, so after a few days he called his brother crying and saying that he needs help, he has no money, no food and did not know where he was. 	\N	\N	1	waypoint	\N	\N
