2118	01010000A0E6100000AA70773A95B451C0BA885BEB4F113BC00000000000000000	2146	Caldera	car	Thu, 23 Apr 2026 22:00:00 GMT	?	 Took me around 2h to find someone, but then luckily all the way to Caldera. He told me how when he was 17, he left home all alone, hitchhiking and walking to the north to find work. He has many many siblings, around 15 if I remember correctly. The parents were very poor, often there was not enough food in the house, let alone clothes. He often got up in the morning around 5 to work on the land for 3h and then go to school. They also divided school time and uniforms with his siblings, so he had very little school education. But then when he arrived close to Copiapo, he managed to find work in the mines, work himself up and now he owns a little business with around 7 employees. His a grandpa now and really thankful to God that his life turned out so well. 	\N	\N	1	waypoint	\N	\N
