2121	01010000A0E6100000728296514B9451C05C17AB153EC837C00000000000000000	2149	Outside of Antofagasta	car	Sat, 25 Apr 2026 22:01:00 GMT	Rodrigo	I only had to wait like 5min and found a ride directly to Antofagasta. He left at midnight in Santiago and was already driving for 11h without sleeping. Just before we met his wheel exploded and could only be fixed with the wrong type of tire. So we were a bit worried if nothing more will happen, but it was fine. He works in buying and selling cars, he always goes to Santiago and drives them then to Antofagasta. He only has to do this like twice a month and earns enough. When he got really tired I offered to take over and also ended up driving for around 1.5h. It was impressive since it was just desert all the way, and sometimes along the ocean. Something curious was that we saw a plane with condensation trails and he was very convinced that it was chem trails, that the plane was releasing something. He has a wife and a little daughter, but just a few weeks ago he ran away to San Pedro with a girl friend for some days. Also when he called his wife the conversation was very cold.  When I got out he gifted me some Colo-Colo sweatpants, that made me very happy	\N	\N	1	waypoint	\N	\N
