2139	01010000A0E610000014F54F509AA651C029734EDAD5622FC00000000000000000	2167	Santa Lucia	truck	Tue, 05 May 2026 22:08:00 GMT	Juan	Another epic ride, on the back of a big truck, on top of the cargo. Going all along the Lake Titicaca and into the mountains. 5h in total on the back, amazing vistas. At one stop the driver asked me to do him a favor. The favor was to record a short video talking to his wife. They are in a fight and she does not respond to him anymore. He wanted me to say that he’s a great guy and is crying and sorry, that she may forgive him. So random haha. When the night came, it got cold, I took out all my clothes and even the sleeping bag. At some point the driver stopped and offered me to come into the cabin. He told me that he had several bad experiences when taking hitchhikers. Once he took a Venezuelan guy, and after some time also invited him into the cabin. When he went out to buy something, the guy stole his phone and wallet. Also another time there was a whole family on the back of the truck, and he offered them several times to come down and go to the toilet, but they refused. When he checked afterwards, he saw that they did their business all over the truck. So I understand that he’s become a bit more careful. 	\N	\N	1	waypoint	\N	\N
